<title>FINLAND: ALCOM 1996 LOSS NARROWS TO FIM 2.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>ALCOM 1996 LOSS NARROWS TO FIM 2.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss before appropriations, tax		2.4 vs 39.6 loss</p>
<p> Loss per share (markka)			  0.2 vs 3.6 loss</p>
<p> Net sales					  101.8 vs 162.9</p>
<p> Operating loss				     1.5 vs 3.9 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 3.5 vs 16.2</p>
<p> Depreciation					 5.0 vs 12.4</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 gain 2.0 vs 36.6 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						  0.1 vs 0.4</p>
<p> Net loss					     2.5 vs 40.0 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish data systems group is Alcom Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0245</p>
</text>
